  "notes": [
    "Partial encoding of Alaska Medicaid Verquvo (vericiguat), effective 2022-01-04. Approval criteria and all explicit denial criteria encoded. Supporting evidence and attestations require manual review.",
    "Cautions (notes only): not studied in end-stage renal disease (ESRD) or hepatic insufficiency; breastfeeding is not recommended.",
    "Duration (notes only): initial approval up to 3 months; reauthorization up to 12 months if the prescriber documents positive clinical response to therapy. Manual review required.",
    "Quantity (notes only): 30 tablets per 30 days, for 2.5 mg, 5 mg, and 10 mg strengths. Manual review required."
  ],
